# Brow credential bridge — deployment artefacts for the author's machine only.
# They mirror a personal Claude OAuth token out of the login keychain, and this
# repo is a public fork. Roadmap item 2.5 deletes the bridge outright once BYOK
# lands; until then it stays local. See brow-agent/docs/04-SECURITY.md.
